      "name_en": "CafeF – Bar and plain-ring gold prices on the morning of Oct 22 at SJC, PNJ, DOJI, Phu Quy, BTMC and Bao Tin Manh Hai (Oct 22, 2026)",
      "facts_en": [
        "Early on Oct 22, SJC, PNJ, DOJI and Bao Tin Manh Hai all quoted bars at 139.3–142.3 million VND per tael; all six dealers surveyed ask 142.3 million and differ only on the bid (138.1–139.3 million)",
        "Plain 9999 rings: SJC 137.4–140.9 million, PNJ 138.4–141.4 million, DOJI 138–142 million, BTMC 138.1–142.1 million, Phu Quy 138.7–141.7 million",
